Työelämän ruotsi — third-party data notices
============================================

Swedish word forms (src/data/sv/wordForms.json)
-----------------------------------------------
The Swedish inflection data (verb chains infinitiv / presens / preteritum /
supinum, noun gender and singular / plural forms) is taken from:

  SALDO morphology (saldom)
  Språkbanken Text, University of Gothenburg
  https://spraakbanken.gu.se/en/resources/saldom

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: a selection of forms was extracted for the words in this app's
vocabulary; the forms themselves are unchanged. Each row keeps its SALDO
lemgram identifier (e.g. "gå..vb.1") so it can be traced back to the source.

The data is generated with scripts/fetch-saldo-forms.mjs (Karp v7 API).

Compound nouns SALDO does not list (e.g. "yrkeshögskola") take the forms of
their last part ("högskola") from SALDO, with the first part prefixed. Such a
row is accepted only when a second, independent source agrees: the declension
class (1-5), or the forms, given for the word in

  Susanna Kananoja: "Vokabulär och fraser om studier — Opiskeluun liittyvää
  sanastoa ja fraaseja" (PDF, 2026-08-07)

stored in scripts/data/declensions-kananoja.json. These rows carry
"check": "kananoja-2026", the head word in "head", and the head's SALDO
lemgram, so they can be traced back to both sources.
